      {
        "deck_links": [],
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "en": "Broodscale Combo continued to climb this week, exceeding 20% of both the high-score field and the Top 8. This may be the first time a Modern archetype has cleared both marks since the most recent bans. Nearly every list was mono-green, while Gruul and other multicolor builds have all but disappeared from the metagame.",
          "zh": "本周孳巢蜥组合技继续爬升，两项占比都超过20%，这在禁牌后的摩登应该是首次出现。而且基本全都是纯绿，红绿等其他混色版本基本已经遭到环境淘汰。"
        }
      },
