        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "en": "An Azorius Chant Control build with a full playset of [[card:Orim's Chant|Orim's Chant]] and three copies of [[card:Silence|Silence]] won two consecutive events: deck:ff48d8612256c0eb6a06. That configuration is well suited to a metagame currently leaning toward combo and midrange-to-slower decks.",
          "zh": "在满编[[card:Orim's Chant|欧琳的吟颂]]之外，还带3张[[card:Silence|封口]]的蓝白吟颂版本连续席卷了两场比赛：deck:ff48d8612256c0eb6a06。相当针对现在相对偏组合技和中慢速套牌的环境。"
